{"speciesId":33,"names":{"fr":"Nidorino","es":"Nidorino","en":"Nidorino","ja":"ニドリーノ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"An aggressive POKéMON that is quick to attack. The horn on its head secretes a powerful venom."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"An aggressive POKéMON that is quick to attack. The horn on its head secretes a powerful venom."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Its horns contain venom. If they are stabbed into an enemy, the impact makes the poison leak out."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It raises its big ears to check its surroundings. If it senses any­ thing, it attacks immediately."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Quick to anger, it stabs enemies with its horn to inject a powerful poison when it becomes agitated."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It is easily agitated and uses its horn for offense as soon as it notices an attacker."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"NIDORINO has a horn that is harder than a diamond. If it senses a hostile presence, all the barbs on its back bristle up at once, and it challenges the foe with all its might."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"NIDORINO has a horn that is harder than a diamond. If it senses a hostile presence, all the barbs on its back bristle up at once, and it challenges the foe with all its might."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its horn is harder than a diamond. If it senses a hostile presence, all the barbs on its back bristle up at once, and it challenges the foe with all its might."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is easily angered. By swinging its well- developed horn wildly, it can even punch through diamond."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"An aggressive POKéMON that is quick to attack. The horn on its head secretes a powerful venom."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It raises its big ears to check its surroundings. If it senses anything, it attacks immediately."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Quick to anger, it stabs enemies with its horn to inject a powerful poison when it becomes agitated."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"D’un tempérament violent, il empale l’ennemi sur sa corne qui distille un poison puissant."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"D’un tempérament violent, il empale l’ennemi sur sa corne qui distille un poison puissant."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il dresse ses oreilles à l’affût d’un bruit suspect et attaque toute menace se rapprochant de lui."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Levanta sus grandes orejas para vigilar. Si detecta algo, atacará de inmediato."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It raises its big ears to check its surroundings. If it senses anything, it attacks immediately."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"発達した 耳を 立てて まわりの 気配を 探る。 なにかあると すぐに 飛びかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Très agressif, il est prompt à répondre à la violence. La corne sur sa tête est venimeuse."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon agresivo, siempre listo para atacar. El cuerno de la cabeza segrega un potente veneno."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"An aggressive Pokémon that is quick to attack. The horn on its head secretes a powerful venom."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"すぐに 怒って 戦おうとする。 しかも 頭の ツノは 刺さると 強烈な 毒素を 出す 仕組み。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nidorino dispose d’une corne plus dure que du diamant. S’il sent une présence hostile, toutes les pointes de son dos se hérissent d’un coup, puis il défie son ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nidorino tiene un cuerno de dureza superior a la del diamante. Si siente una presencia hostil, se le erizan las púas del lomo enseguida y carga contra el enemigo con todas sus fuerzas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nidorino has a horn that is harder than a diamond. If it senses a hostile presence, all the barbs on its back bristle up at once, and it challenges the foe with all its might."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ダイヤモンドよりも 硬い ツノを 持つ。 敵の 気配を 感じると 背中の トゲが 一斉に 逆立ち 全力で 立ち向かう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nidorino dispose d’une corne plus dure que du diamant. S’il sent une présence hostile, toutes les pointes de son dos se hérissent d’un coup, puis il défie son ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nidorino tiene un cuerno de dureza superior a la del diamante. Si siente una presencia hostil, se le erizan las púas del lomo enseguida y carga contra el enemigo con todas sus fuerzas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nidorino has a horn that is harder than a diamond. If it senses a hostile presence, all the barbs on its back bristle up at once, and it challenges the foe with all its might."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ダイヤモンドよりも 硬い ツノを 持つ。 敵の 気配を 感じると 背中の トゲが 一斉に 逆立ち 全力で 立ち向かう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Sa corne est venimeuse. Si elle perce un ennemi, elle lui injecte un poison violent."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"El cuerno de su frente contiene toxinas que se liberan al punzar al rival."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Its horn contains venom. If it stabs an enemy with the horn, the impact makes the poison leak out."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"頭にある ツノの 毒素は 突き刺したときの 衝撃で にじみ出る 仕組みだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Sa corne est venimeuse. Si elle perce un ennemi, elle lui injecte un poison violent."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"El cuerno de su frente contiene toxinas que se liberan al punzar al rival."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Its horn contains venom. If it stabs an enemy with the horn, the impact makes the poison leak out."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"頭にある ツノの 毒素は 突き刺したときの 衝撃で にじみ出る 仕組みだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il erre à la recherche d’une Pierre Lune, brisant tous les rochers sur son passage avec sa corne plus solide qu’un diamant."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Dondequiera que va, parte rocas con su cuerno, más duro que un diamante, en busca de una Piedra Lunar."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"With a horn that’s harder than diamond, this Pokémon goes around shattering boulders as it searches for a moon stone."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ダイヤモンドより 硬い ツノで 岩石を 砕いて まわる。 つきのいしを 探しているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"D’un naturel nerveux, il est prompt à se battre. Lorsqu’il a une montée d’adrénaline, la concentration de son poison augmente."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es nervioso y agresivo por naturaleza. Cuando suben sus niveles de adrenalina, la concentración de toxinas en su veneno aumenta."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s nervous and qu